Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Eighth Episode\NThe Black Knight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.02,0:02:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So..\NAccording to what is written here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"a fighting dog is a dog\Nthat only knows fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a dog that has been kept\Naway from its mother since it was a puppy..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.82,0:02:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...and forced to become\Nautonomous and independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.34,0:02:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It only knows how to fight\Nand knows neither pain nor joy"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly isn't nice\Nnot feeling emotions... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good morning, Doctor Uranaru!\N- Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.82,0:02:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- What are you reading?\N"What is interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...is that the only thing\Nhe has on his mind is the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning he thinks of nothing else\Nbut succeeding in defeating him."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But who are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.50,0:02:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Him! Don't you see?\NHe is a fighting dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,meaning a dog\Nthat doesn't feel emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, he's after me!\NEasy! Easy! Be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But... But this is the dog\Nof Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe there are animals that feel\Nneither emotions nor feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Any animal\Nunderstands if we love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, big dog!\NDid you see, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right! Look\Nhow docile this little dog is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.86,0:03:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so docile and tame!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing\Nto my puppy, Doctor Uranaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin!\NYou should keep him in a kennel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This puppy of yours\Nseems rather dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, little dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone is crazy enough to get\Nbitten by such a sweet little dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,too bad for him!\NAnyway, later, I will show you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- a very funny thing!\N- Funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't wait to see it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Grand Duke! So I\Nwould have been crazy enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...to let myself be bitten\Nby this stupid mutt, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who put this rope here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This corridor is the shortest\Nway to get to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible dog! Attacking\Nfrom behind like that, all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here we are! Here we are!\N- Are you alright, Princess Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes!\N- We feared it had overwhelmed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beast! It's\Nbetter to eliminate him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop! Wait! I would like to\Nknow who this dog belongs to...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Why are you standing\Naround my fighting dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is he yours?\N- Of course, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I raised him myself. This is\Nwhat I was telling you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This, then, would\Nbe the fun thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lock him in a cell!\N- Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Prince: here is what is\Ndefined as "a fighting dog."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You are cruel, Grand Duke,\Nto treat a dog like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.66,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't feel sorry for him! A\Nfighting dog must be raised this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.70,0:05:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see this dog?\NGood, now pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I will introduce his mother into the cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch closely what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! You are mother and\Nson! Don't maul each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How violent they are! Couldn't\Nyou make them into kinder dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No! That would be like betraying\Ntheir nature as fighting dogs, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.02,0:06:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad not to love\None's own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.90,0:06:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Uranaru, in your\Nopinion, is there a way...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.46,0:06:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...to make the fighting\Ndog normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late for them now,\Nthey are already trained!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I deplore this pastime!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.70,0:06:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Look at those beautiful tulips\Nalready in bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- I grew them myself.\N- Doctor Uranaru,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- may I go to the neighboring kingdom?\N- To the neighboring kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:07:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Franz I'd bring him\Nthe first tulips to bloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! No passing through here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.46,0:07:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you to order me to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, instead? Don't you know\Nthat Silverland begins here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.70,0:07:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to act like a rogue?\NBoys, let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.78,0:08:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of softies! Make way\Nfor Ginar, future knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard there is\Na brave Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...named Sapphire,\Nin this kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to challenge the Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! To become a knight\NI must defeat a brave warrior...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...and, since the bravest\Nof all is Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.22,0:08:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it is she whom I intend to beat!\NShow me the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it is her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a border guard!\NBut what is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This man\Nwants to challenge you, Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:09:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- So you are Sapphire, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And who are you?\NWhy are you looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to challenge you to a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.74,0:09:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a famous knight,\Ndespite being a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will be knighted\Nby my King if I defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- En garde! - I cannot\Nfight against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a foreigner\Nand you have done nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, now, I am very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then take them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The tulips that I was supposed to give to Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Ginar! Since you have provoked me, I accept the challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.30,0:09:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, put yourself on guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.42,0:09:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.42,0:09:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They are just simple tulips! But what is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,These flowers remind me of my mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother loved tulips so much and I loved her so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.26,0:10:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did your mother abandon you, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! When my father died and\Nleft us alone, I cried for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.58,0:10:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother saw me crying\Nso much and she left...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...saying that someone so\Nweak couldn't be her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She abandoned me because she\Nwanted me to become stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand! So you\Nwant to become a knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...to restore your\Nfamily's honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.82,0:10:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, the Black Knight! Him\Nagain! He followed me all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been hunting me since I was\Na child! Now I don't care about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must only think about beating you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Now you are in my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's an avalanche!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.10,0:12:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginar, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginar, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness, you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to grab the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! I won't\Nallow my rival to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't be stupid!\N- Go away! I said I won't..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you're being reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now try to be so until the very end. Don't\Nthink about the challenge and go back home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! I will fight\Nagainst you until the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.82,0:14:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The rope is very strong,\Nso stay calm! You'll make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Opale, why did you stop so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a black glove... It must have been\Ndropped by the knight who was spying on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold, isn't it, dear? Would\Nyou like a sweet and a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you, mother. You're very kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why were you so deep in thought?\N- I was thinking about this glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- A black glove?\N- Is it too big for you, mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's just right for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?\NThen the black knight is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.10,0:14:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is trying to force their way\Ninto the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:15:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I'll force my way through\Nif you don't let me pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture that stranger!\NDon't let him pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Step forward,\Nif you have the courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Prince!\NDon't be a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You are foolish if you think\Na rope is enough to stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:16:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is following me?\NWhat are these dogs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.70,0:16:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you, you filthy beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginar is struggling with the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you beasts!\NYou certainly don't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.26,0:16:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, little dogs,\Nget back in your cells!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Grand Duke Duralumin.\NWith whom do I have the pleasure of speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.86,0:16:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Ginar,\Nfrom the kingdom of Boulioule...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I have come here to challenge\NPrincess Sapphire to a duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me pass!\NI have a letter of introduction..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:17:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...signed by my King, which attests\Nto the reason for my challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.06,0:17:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Challenge Sapphire?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem more ferocious than my dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.22,0:17:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A knight cannot help but accept the challenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,when the challenger shows\Na letter signed by a King.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Come then! Take me to her
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no rush.\NCome with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke is right,\NI must accept that challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Wait!\NWait, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, Doctor Uranaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me! Has that boy\Nperhaps harmed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, but...\N- And he doesn't hate you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He is only following the rules\Nof knighthood,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,which obliges him to challenge\Na famous knight...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,..to obtain his investiture!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will I look in front of\Neveryone if I don't accept his challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's exactly the point!\NIf you don't accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.26,0:17:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you will break a bad law!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And a better one can be made,\Ndon't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Aren't you sleeping?\N- I'm too nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I be able to fight her tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! Now sleep peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.42,0:18:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?!\NAnd what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.06,0:18:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A tulip! I can't help\Nbut think of my mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...when I see one.\N- Ginar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginar, it's me: your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama! Mama, is it you?\NWhere are you? Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginar, listen to your mother's\Nvoice! Don't challenge Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginar, you are not a dog.\NIt won't make you happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,fighting like a fighting\Ndog to obtain knighthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Ginar! You\Nwere certainly not born to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:19:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late, mother! In my\Nlife I have fought strenuously...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...against many people! By now this\Nis the only thing I know how to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.70,0:19:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Where are you, mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.30,0:19:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- What’s happening, Ginar?\N- What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Grand Duke Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.62,0:19:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- I see with pleasure that you are in good shape.\N- What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m taking this stupid\Nflower from your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not a sissy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.74,0:19:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are so soft-hearted,\Nyou will not defeat Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- You must be tougher!\N- I will defeat her, instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.62,0:19:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You will see what I am capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The trick didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.54,0:19:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I won't be\Nable to help but fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.90,0:20:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince Sapphire!\N- Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? Sapphire has\Ndisappeared?! Where did she go, Doctor Uranaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know!\N- She ran away! She's afraid to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the heir of\NSilverland is a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin,\Nwatch how you speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me angry,\Notherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,With such a cowardly heir to the\Nthrone, the kingdom is not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lord!\NWhere could Sapphire have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- To tell the truth, she is...\N- Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Princess!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.14,0:20:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself,\Nchicken-hearted Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you hidden\Nyourself? Are you so afraid of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, don't be a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.74,0:20:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.90,0:21:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens forbid! It's not\Nout of fear that I'm hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've found you, Sapphire! It\Nwasn't by hiding in the dungeons..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.70,0:21:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,. ...that you could escape\Nme! Choose your weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.70,0:21:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ginar, please, give up\Nthe idea of knighthood!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to take a weapon,\Nwhichever one you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.38,0:21:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Or do you prefer to declare yourself defeated already?\N- The whip!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.94,0:21:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop, Ginar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Black Knight!\N- But who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:21:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mother!\N- Ginar, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.62,0:22:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me. I sneaked into\Nthe castle and saw everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I followed you, disguised\Nas the Black Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to forge you through dangers\Nand to help you regain your honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.58,0:22:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,pushing you to fight\Nagainst brave men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have realized\Nhow wrong I was..
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...and how I have\Nmade you unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, the dog has become\Na human being!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My heartfelt thanks, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.94,0:22:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are the bravest.\NI will not forget you, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you.\NI won't forget you either!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.62,0:22:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye and good luck!
